; Historical evidence remains v1; local v2 acceptance is source-bound and retains
; native-port/extraction/serialization/admission/crypto and production-review boundaries.
; Projection storage may grow with output; native-port classification remains explicit.
; Extraction/serialization/admission/crypto are external unless separately proved.

